<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Hoher Kasten–Saxer Lücke–Brülisau — Hoher Kasten–Saxer Lücke–Brülisau</name><desc>Walk from Hoher Kasten via Staubern, Saxerlücke, Bollenwees and Sämtisersee to Plattenbödeli, then descend through the Brüeltobel to Pfannenstiel and Brülisau. A short track at Plattenbödeli is reserved for inn customers: plan a food or drink stop there and confirm the inn is open before taking this itinerary.

